# camp-magic: load saved game A, make camp (E) and use the camp menus: the magic menu (cast, memorise, the slots left, the effects of
# spells in force), scrolls, the party order (move a member up or down). Covers ovl15 (CampMagicMenu, MemorizeSpells, PartyOrderMenu,
# DisplaySpellEffects, ...), the spell lists of ovl22 and the party's menus of ovl19/ovl20. Found with the coverage-guided
# explorer (tools/c/explore_climb.py), pruned to the keys that matter. The camp screen is animated, so its keys are `press` with long waits (the game drops a key that arrives while it is busy).
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
press E
wait 30
press HOME
wait 100
press M
wait 100
press S
wait 100
press M
wait 100
press D
wait 100
press ENTER
wait 100
press C
wait 100
press R
wait 100
press M
wait 100
press 2
wait 100
press E
wait 100
press HOME
wait 100
shot camp-end
wait 30
quit
